Hi all,

I'm happy to announce a port of Nethack 3.4.3 to the Nokia 9200
Communicator series. The software supports Nokia 9210, 9210i, and
9290, and I have also reports that it works on the new Nokia 9500
Communicator (not yet available). Get it at

        http://www.modeemi.fi/~pekangas/nethack/

The port is based on vanilla Nethack 3.4.3, and is partially based on
Duncan Booth's port to EPOC Release 5 and Psion devices. My approach
to the overall architecture and the user interface implementation is
quite different from Duncan's, however.

The port is still in progress, and while the game itself is fully
playable, bugs may still remain. Making backups of the savegame is
recommended, just don't cheat!

Feedback, bug reports, and patches are welcome. I am open to
enchancement suggestions, but can't really spend much time working on
this, so there isn't that much I can realistically promise to do. I
might port this to Series 60 devices too, and ideas on how to
implement a useful user interface with a small display and no keyboard
are welcome too.


